	<center><h2>My Unforgettable Trip to Paris</h2></center>

    <center><p>
        Paris is one of the most beautiful cities in the world.
        It is famous for the Eiffel Tower, museums, and delicious food.
        During my visit, I explored famous landmarks and learned about
        French culture. The city was full of beauty and excitement.
    </p></center>
	
	<center><p>
        My favourite experience was visiting the Eiffel Tower and
        enjoying the beautiful views of the city. I also enjoyed
        walking through the streets and tasting local food.
        It was a memorable travel experience.
    </p></center>
<br><br>
    <center><blockquote>
        Travel expands the mind.
    </blockquote></center>
